Masmur

Kitab Masmur saka &lt;a href="basa%20Ibrani"&gt;basa Ibrani&lt;/a&gt;:תהילים mizmor utawa kerep ditulis mitsmor. Ing sawatara &lt;a href="basa"&gt;basa&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt; kitab iki diarani "Psalm" kang dijupuk saka &lt;a href="basa%20Yunani"&gt;basa Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: "Psalmos". Ing &lt;a href="basa%20Melayu"&gt;basa Melayu&lt;/a&gt; kitab iki diarani kitab &lt;a href="Zabur"&gt;Zabur&lt;/a&gt;, saka &lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt;.
Masmur iku buku kidung-kidung. Katonané kitab iki yasané Ratu &lt;a href="Dawud"&gt;Dawud&lt;/a&gt;. Gusti &lt;a href="Y%C3%A8sus"&gt;Yèsus&lt;/a&gt; uga akèh ngasta ayat-ayat Masmur.
<h2>Miturut Kapitayan Islam</h2>
Miturut Kapitayan Islam.
