<doc id="1793" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1793" title="Mahabharata">
Mahabharata

Mahabharata (&lt;a href="basa%20Sansekreta"&gt;basa Sansekreta&lt;/a&gt;: Mahābhārata, Carakan: ꦩꦲꦴꦨꦴꦫꦠ), iku karya sastra kuna sing ujaré ditulis déning bagawan &lt;a href="Abyasa"&gt;Abyasa&lt;/a&gt; utawa Vyasa saka &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;. Buku iku kabangun saka wolulas kitab, mula diarani &lt;a href="Astadasaparwa"&gt;Astadasaparwa&lt;/a&gt; (asta = 8, dasa = 10, parwa = kitab).
Cekaking wuwus, Mahabharata nyritakaké pasulayan para &lt;a href="Pandhawa"&gt;Pandhawa&lt;/a&gt; karo sedulur nak-dhèrèké, para &lt;a href="Korawa"&gt;Korawa&lt;/a&gt;, prakara nagara &lt;a href="Astina"&gt;Astina&lt;/a&gt;. Wusanané dadi &lt;a href="perang"&gt;perang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bharatayuddha"&gt;Bharatayuddha&lt;/a&gt; (Brantayuda) ing &lt;a href="tegal%20Kurus%C3%A9tra"&gt;tegal Kurusétra&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning 18 dina.
<h2>Pratélan kitab</h2>
Pratélan kitab.
Mahābhārata minangka carita èpik sing kapérang dadi wolulas kitab utawa kerep ingaran &lt;a href="Astadasaparwa"&gt;Astadasaparwa&lt;/a&gt;. Reroncèning kitab nyaritakaké urutan prastawa sajeroning carita Mahābhārata, yaiku wiwit carita para leluhur &lt;a href="Pandhawa"&gt;Pandhawa&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Kurawa"&gt;Kurawa&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Yayati"&gt;Yayati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yadu"&gt;Yadu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puru"&gt;Puru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kuru%20%28Mahabharata%29"&gt;Kuru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Duswanta"&gt;Duswanta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sakuntala"&gt;Sakuntala&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bharata"&gt;Bharata&lt;/a&gt;) nganti carita ditampané &lt;a href="Pandhawa"&gt;Pandhawa&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="swarga"&gt;swarga&lt;/a&gt;.
