<doc id="1834" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=1834" title="I Makabe">
I Makabe

I Makabe iku siji kitab &lt;a href="Deuterokanonika"&gt;Deuterokanonika&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Alkitab"&gt;Alkitab&lt;/a&gt;. Dadi tegesé ora ana asliné ing &lt;a href="basa%20Ibrani"&gt;basa Ibrani&lt;/a&gt;. Anané mung alihbasané ing &lt;a href="basa%20Yunani"&gt;basa Yunani&lt;/a&gt;. Kitab iki katonané katulis ing sakiwa-tengené taun &lt;a href="100%20SM"&gt;100 SM&lt;/a&gt;, sawisé ana nagara Yahudi kang mardika manèh.
Kitab iki isiné dipara dadi 16 sargah (bab).
Kitab iki isiné bab tlatah Yudea kang dibedhah déning wong-wong Yunani kang dibawahi &lt;a href="Aleksander%20Agung"&gt;Aleksander Agung&lt;/a&gt;. Banjur wong-wong &lt;a href="Yahudi"&gt;Yahudi&lt;/a&gt; padha ngraman kebèh. Périodhe kang katulis ing kitab iki kira-kira antara &lt;a href="175%20SM"&gt;175 SM&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="134%20SM"&gt;134 SM&lt;/a&gt;.

